"lines": [
{
"text": "When the earth was new to man,",
"start": 10.321,
"end": 13.721
},
{
"text": "and the image of God was in his hands...",
"start": 16.061,
"end": 19.301
},
{
"text": "Adam begot a son in his likeness,",
"start": 25.202,
"end": 27.382
},
{
"text": "after his own form, under the garden's shadow.",
"start": 29.182,
"end": 32.762
},
{
"text": "And he called his name Seth,",
"start": 34.883,
"end": 36.643
},
{
"text": "for God had set him down where the wound could grow.",
"start": 36.823,
"end": 39.983
},
{
"text": "And the days went on like weather,",
"start": 40.663,
"end": 42.783
},
{
"text": "and sons and daughters followed after.",
"start": 43.343,
"end": 45.663
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 45.723,
"end": 48.263
},
{
"text": "go on, go on, go on",
"start": 48.784,
"end": 50.804
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 51.204,
"end": 53.784
},
{
"text": "and the dust keeps singing on",
"start": 54.304,
"end": 56.404
},
{
"text": "In sons and daughters",
"start": 56.564,
"end": 57.964
},
{
"text": "the line goes on",
"start": 58.204,
"end": 67.885
},
{
"text": "Seth lived and begot Enos,",
"start": 68.025,
"end": 69.985
},
{
"text": "then men began to call on the Name.",
"start": 70.605,
"end": 72.505
},
{
"text": "Enos begot Cainan,",
"start": 73.825,
"end": 75.505
},
{
"text": "and Cainan begot Maleleel,",
"start": 75.665,
"end": 77.786
},
{
"text": "and the years were long as lamp smoke",
"start": 78.826,
"end": 81.286
},
{
"text": "over the homes of the earth.",
"start": 81.426,
"end": 83.586
},
{
"text": "Sons and daughters, sons and daughters,",
"start": 84.026,
"end": 86.486
},
{
"text": "one after one, the name survives.",
"start": 86.906,
"end": 89.326
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 89.366,
"end": 91.907
},
{
"text": "go on, go on, go on",
"start": 92.427,
"end": 94.607
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 94.827,
"end": 97.487
},
{
"text": "and the dust keeps singing on",
"start": 97.927,
"end": 100.027
},
{
"text": "In sons and daughters",
"start": 100.227,
"end": 101.547
},
{
"text": "the line goes on",
"start": 101.847,
"end": 111.328
},
{
"text": "Maleleel begot Jared,",
"start": 111.768,
"end": 113.268
},
{
"text": "and Jared begot Enoch.",
"start": 114.428,
"end": 116.148
},
{
"text": "Then came the old refrain,",
"start": 117.268,
"end": 119.089
},
{
"text": "the house of man, the count of days.",
"start": 119.189,
"end": 121.809
},
{
"text": "Mathusala rose from Enoch,",
"start": 121.889,
"end": 124.169
},
{
"text": "and Lamech from Mathusala,",
"start": 124.649,
"end": 126.909
},
{
"text": "and still the ground held its burden",
"start": 127.569,
"end": 130.069
},
{
"text": "beneath every foot that walked.",
"start": 130.589,
"end": 132.61
},
{
"text": "Death in the doorway,",
"start": 133.13,
"end": 134.35
},
{
"text": "death at the gate,",
"start": 135.83,
"end": 136.65
},
{
"text": "every cradle leaning",
"start": 138.31,
"end": 139.81
},
{
"text": "toward the same old wait...",
"start": 140.77,
"end": 142.29
},
{
"text": "death in the doorway,",
"start": 144.01,
"end": 145.25
},
{
"text": "death in the shade,",
"start": 146.731,
"end": 147.551
},
{
"text": "until one walked different",
"start": 148.991,
"end": 150.731
},
{
"text": "and the silence broke its chain",
"start": 151.211,
"end": 153.911
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 154.771,
"end": 157.551
},
{
"text": "go on, go on, go on",
"start": 157.831,
"end": 160.091
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 160.212,
"end": 162.972
},
{
"text": "and the dust keeps singing on",
"start": 163.312,
"end": 165.412
},
{
"text": "In sons and daughters",
"start": 165.572,
"end": 167.072
},
{
"text": "the line goes on",
"start": 167.112,
"end": 176.833
},
{
"text": "Enoch walked with God,",
"start": 177.253,
"end": 178.773
},
{
"text": "and he pleased Him in the path.",
"start": 179.673,
"end": 181.473
},
{
"text": "No darkness took him down,",
"start": 182.313,
"end": 184.313
},
{
"text": "no grave laid claim to his breath.",
"start": 184.513,
"end": 187.053
},
{
"text": "He walked with God,",
"start": 187.093,
"end": 188.734
},
{
"text": "and God took him.",
"start": 190.134,
"end": 191.274
},
{
"text": "And heaven opened like a door",
"start": 192.874,
"end": 195.174
},
{
"text": "for a man who stayed so near.",
"start": 196.014,
"end": 200.754
},
{
"text": "Then back to earth, the names remain,",
"start": 200.834,
"end": 203.155
},
{
"text": "the lamps still burn, the hands still ache.",
"start": 203.495,
"end": 206.055
},
{
"text": "Mathusala, Lamech, the old road wide,",
"start": 206.235,
"end": 208.795
},
{
"text": "the promise moving under the weight.",
"start": 208.895,
"end": 211.435
},
{
"text": "Lamech looked on the cursed ground,",
"start": 211.655,
"end": 214.415
},
{
"text": "on the sweat and thorns and the wearied face,",
"start": 214.475,
"end": 217.096
},
{
"text": "and spoke of rest through trembling breath:",
"start": 217.196,
"end": 219.616
},
{
"text": "\u201cFrom our toil, this one will bring us ease.\u201d",
"start": 220.316,
"end": 225.296
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 225.416,
"end": 228.116
},
{
"text": "go on, go on, go on",
"start": 228.496,
"end": 230.437
},
{
"text": "The generations of Adam",
"start": 230.897,
"end": 233.617
},
{
"text": "and the dust keeps singing on",
"start": 234.017,
"end": 236.117
},
{
"text": "Noe",
"start": 236.237,
"end": 236.877
},
{
"text": "will lift the ache of ground",
"start": 236.937,
"end": 238.897
},
{
"text": "Noe",
"start": 239.257,
"end": 239.597
},
{
"text": "will bear the mercy down",
"start": 239.617,
"end": 241.657
},
{
"text": "Sons and daughters,",
"start": 241.957,
"end": 243.337
},
{
"text": "the line goes on",
"start": 243.397,
"end": 250.138
},
{
"text": "Noe begot Shem,",
"start": 251.458,
"end": 253.498
},
{
"text": "and Ham,",
"start": 254.298,
"end": 254.958
},
{
"text": "and Japheth.",
"start": 255.638,
"end": 256.738
},
{
"text": "The road goes on...",
"start": 256.998,
"end": 263.319
},
{
"text": "the road goes on...",
"start": 263.459,
"end": 265.059
}
